WEBVTT

00:06:25.636 --> 00:06:30.196
a system that disconnects us
from nature, the soil, the forest,

00:06:30.196 --> 00:06:32.236
the ocean, the air.

00:06:33.556 --> 00:06:37.676
We fail to protect all other
forms of wildlife

00:06:37.676 --> 00:06:41.396
that we share this magnificent
and sometimes awful planet with.

00:06:43.116 --> 00:06:46.276
So our lack of respect
for the other-than-human

00:06:46.316 --> 00:06:49.236
is also a lack of respect for humankind.

00:06:53.156 --> 00:06:54.436
Look at this.

00:06:57.796 --> 00:06:58.956
It's just ...